<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal offers repo, no change fixed rates.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal offers repo, no change fixed rates.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal offered a 10 billion escudo variable rate repurchase pact on Tuesday but left its fixed money market rates unchanged for the start of the new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>Bids for the funds must be received by 1515 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
